# Performance

Always generate efficient code.

## RecyclerView

Use

- DiffUtil
- ListAdapter where appropriate
- Stable IDs when beneficial

## Memory

Avoid unnecessary object creation.

Reuse objects when possible.

Avoid leaks.

## UI

Never perform heavy work on Main thread.

Avoid expensive operations inside

- onBindViewHolder
- draw
- layout

## Startup

Keep startup lightweight.

Lazy initialize expensive components.

## General

Prefer efficient algorithms.

Avoid duplicate work.

Keep rendering smooth.